v5
const wallet3 = new ethers.Wallet.fromMnemonic(phrase)

v6
const wallet3 = new ethers.Wallet.fromPhrase(phrase)

2/
不再需要引用子包（比如 providers, utils），直接在根包中引用函数。
v5:
const provider = new ethers.providers.JsonRpcProvider(URL)

v6:
const provider = new ethers.JsonRpcProvider(URL)

